    skos:example "Mayonnaise, milk."@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Emulsion"@en ;
    emmo:elucidation "An emulsion is a mixture of two or more liquids that are normally immiscible (a liquid-liquid heterogeneous mixture)."@en .

